// Smart quotes, resolved from the content around them.

--- double-quotes ---
He said "hello" and left.
│ <p>He said “hello” and left.</p>

--- single-quotes ---
She said 'hello' and left.
│ <p>She said ‘hello’ and left.</p>

--- apostrophe ---
The dog's bone.
│ <p>The dog’s bone.</p>

--- nested-quotes ---
"He said 'hello' to me."
│ <p>“He said ‘hello’ to me.”</p>

--- primes ---
The board is 5'11" long.
│ <p>The board is 5′11″ long.</p>

--- quotes-do-not-cross-a-paragraph ---
An "unclosed quotation

and a new paragraph.
│ <p>An “unclosed quotation</p>
│ <p>and a new paragraph.</p>

--- quotes-do-not-cross-a-list-item ---
- An "unclosed quotation
- and the next item
│ <ul>
│ <li>An “unclosed quotation</li>
│ <li>and the next item</li>
│ </ul>
